    <title>
      <narrative xml:lang="en">NESA SSN South Asia "Security Trends and Challenges in South Asia" Working Group 01-23</narrative>
    </title>
    <description type="1">
      <narrative xml:lang="en">The NESA Center partnered with the Bangladesh Center for Indo-Pacific Affairs (BCIPA) to conduct a 2.5 day seminar focused on "Security Trends and Challenges in South Asia." Topics included security challenges, climate change, migration, violent extremism, rule of law and policing, and global power politics.</narrative>
