    <title>
      <narrative xml:lang="en">NESA Center Ottawa Dialogue India-Pakistan Sessions 01-25</narrative>
    </title>
    <description type="1">
      <narrative xml:lang="en">Adjunct Professor Jack Gill participated in three Ottawa Dialogue India-Pakistan sessions from 16 to 22 February 2025 in Bangkok, Thailand: the military-to-military group, the nuclear group, and the Kingston group focused specifically on Kashmir as a bilateral India-Pakistan irritant. These three meetings followed the usual pattern for Ottawa Dialogue interactions, in each case, a small group of 4 to 6 Indians met with 4 to 6 Pakistanis with Ottawa University.</narrative>
    </description>
