    <title>
      <narrative xml:lang="en">International Counterproliferation Program (ICP): International Dual-Use Investigations</narrative>
    </title>
    <description type="1">
      <narrative xml:lang="en">ICP delivered the International Dual-Use Investigation Workshop to 43 participants from various agencies from Bangladesh, India, Maldives, and Sri Lanka. This course instructed enforcement authorities about techniques to successfully pursue transnational investigations of dual-use items related to WMD material. This multi-lateral workshop was critical in developing stronger relationships between these regional partners in countering the proliferation of dual-use items.</narrative>
